    {
      "what": "capacity and depletion",
      "why": "The EMF stays at 9.0 V and the internal resistance stays at 1.7 ohm. A real 9 V alkaline holds roughly 550 to 600 mAh at 25 mA (far less at heavy drains), and its open-circuit voltage falls while its internal resistance rises as it discharges.",
